er updating `metadata.json` and `index.html` can happen alongside or even before `set_up_oauth`. This will ensure the project is correctly named and has the geolocation permission and title set prior to the OAuth flow. I\'m double-checking the instructions on the OAuth setup process to ensure I\'m adhering to the required steps, specifically the immediate conversation stop after calling the tool with `userConfirmedInUI: false`, and that the ensuing text response is compliant.\n\n\n"
