  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining Server Components**\n\nI\'m currently outlining the core components of `server.ts`. It will listen on port 3000 at host 0.0.0.0 and will incorporate JSON body parsing using `express.json()`. I\'m planning to manage the records in `staff_presence.xlsx` and persist a set of staff IDs in the `data/` directory.\n\n\n**Implementing Login and API**\n\nI\'ve just added login functionality, including dummy staff accounts for testing, and the `/api/login` endpoint. I\'ve also set up a `/api/status` endpoint to check if a staff member has pushed their location. I\'m focusing on the `/api/push` endpoint, which will handle location pushes, including validation, timestamp formatting, and XLSX updates, plus persistence in a JSON file.\n\n\n"
