  planner_response {
    response: "I have built the dummy Staff Location Attendance prototype application for **Rajalakshmi Institute of Technology (RIT)**.\n\n### Functional Overview\n\n- **Authentication**:\n  - Direct login interface configured with dummy credentials (`STAFF001` / `staff123`, `STAFF002`, `STAFF003`).\n  - Labeled with a demo notice for prototype clarity.\n\n- **Staff Screen**:\n  - Centered single-action interface displaying solely the **Staff ID** and the **`[ PUSH ]`** button.\n  - Omitted all secondary dashboards, history lists, navigation bars, and administrative controls.\n  - Automatically transitions to **`[ PUSHED ]`** in a disabled state immediately upon recording.\n\n- **Campus Geofencing**:\n  - Modular geofencing module containing the bounding ranges for all campus locations (*A / Admin Block, B Block, C Blocks C1\342\200\223C4, Steve Jobs, Green Building, Invisible Statue, Canteen Bill Counter, Canteen Calcutta Box*). Coordinates outside these ranges are classified as `Outside`.\n  - Architecture prepared for substituting bounding boxes with polygon point-in-polygon checks.\n\n- **Data Persistence & Excel Export**:\n  - Records the server-generated timestamp (`YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM:SS`), Staff ID, latitude, longitude, and detected campus location.\n  - Automatically generates and appends entries to `staff_presence.xlsx`.\n  - Server-side duplicate prevention ensures each staff member can push only once per session.\n\n- **Dual Runtime Support**:\n  - Live full-stack execution in Google AI Studio via the Express/TypeScript service.\n  - Standalone Python Flask backend provided for local execution (`python app.py`)."
    modified_response: "I have built the dummy Staff Location Attendance prototype application for **Rajalakshmi Institute of Technology (RIT)**.\n\n### Functional Overview\n\n- **Authentication**:\n  - Direct login interface configured with dummy credentials (`STAFF001` / `staff123`, `STAFF002`, `STAFF003`).\n  - Labeled with a demo notice for prototype clarity.\n\n- **Staff Screen**:\n  - Centered single-action interface displaying solely the **Staff ID** and the **`[ PUSH ]`** button.\n  - Omitted all secondary dashboards, history lists, navigation bars, and administrative controls.\n  - Automatically transitions to **`[ PUSHED ]`** in a disabled state immediately upon recording.\n\n- **Campus Geofencing**:\n  - Modular geofencing module containing the bounding ranges for all campus locations (*A / Admin Block, B Block, C Blocks C1\342\200\223C4, Steve Jobs, Green Building, Invisible Statue, Canteen Bill Counter, Canteen Calcutta Box*). Coordinates outside these ranges are classified as `Outside`.\n  - Architecture prepared for substituting bounding boxes with polygon point-in-polygon checks.\n\n- **Data Persistence & Excel Export**:\n  - Records the server-generated timestamp (`YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM:SS`), Staff ID, latitude, longitude, and detected campus location.\n  - Automatically generates and appends entries to `staff_presence.xlsx`.\n  - Server-side duplicate prevention ensures each staff member can push only once per session.\n\n- **Dual Runtime Support**:\n  - Live full-stack execution in Google AI Studio via the Express/TypeScript service.\n  - Standalone Python Flask backend provided for local execution (`python app.py`)."
